                                "example_id": "381e35d0-0baf-4faf-858b-90b95a1de54b",
                                "sense_id": "469b5a00-f52e-3fe8-aca6-3ba9257e7886",
                                "text": "Teach us that wealth is not elegance; that profusion is not magnificence; and that splendour is not beauty. Teach us that taste is a talisman which can do greater wonders than the millions of the loanmonger."
                            },
